      "content": "Losing someone close can be a grappling experience, and it's completely normal to feel lost without the person who mattered most. It's not just about \"giving it time\" or \"waiting for it to get easier,\" but rather acknowledging the depth of your pain and taking time to grieve. Allow yourself to feel the weight of your emotions, and don't hesitate to express your feelings to those who can offer genuine support and understanding.",
